nd the gift box; kickoff was 5 Oct, first review 8 Oct 15:00 UTC, and **final files are due 20 Nov 2026**.\n- **Constraints and money** — keep blue somewhere, as it has been on every Aozora cup since 1962; budget is **JPY 1,850,000**, fixed in the signed proposal.","createdAt":1794305966850}],"content":"- **What it is** — Aozora Ceramics'' rebrand brief, prepared for Fernhill Studio by Kenji Watanabe, Aozora''s brand manager, aimed at design-led cafes, restaurants and home cooks in Japan and Europe.\n- **What''s owed** — a wordmark and mark (three options due at the first review), a colour and type system, and packaging for mugs, plates and the gift box; kickoff was 5 Oct, first review 8 Oct 15:00 UTC, and **final files are due 20 Nov 2026**.\n- **Constraints and money** — keep blue somewhere, as it has been on every Aozora cup since 1962; budget is **JPY 1,850,000**, fixed in the signed proposal.","metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"}}','assistant','v2','2026-11-10T10:19:26.850Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
