ly: overlapping but not the same. Note the email content again.\n\nTurn sent 10:19:26. No tools needed — I have both texts. Keep concise."}],"createdAt":1794305974647},{"type":"text","text":"**Partly — they agree on one date and not on the deadlines.**\n\n| Date | Kickoff email (Raj, 21 Sep) | brief.md |\n|---|---|---|\n| Start / kickoff | 5 Oct 2026 — \"we agreed to start the rebrand on October 5\" | Kickoff 2026-10-05 ✓ same |\n| First review | mentioned (\"the first review\") but **no date given** | 2026-10-08 15:00 UTC |\n| Moodboard | **due Friday — 25 Sep 2026** | not mentioned |\n| Final files | **not mentioned** | **2026-11-20** |\n\nSo the email never states a final-files date, and the brief never mentions the moodboard or its 25 Sep deadline. The 8 Oct first review is named in both but only dated in the brief — the email''s invite for it came separately, on 24 Sep.\n\nThe upshot: **the 20 Nov deadline exists only in the brief.** It''s not been restated in any mail you can see, which is part of why it''s been easy to lose track of — no inbox message is chasing it.","createdAt":1794305974647}],"content":"**Partly — they agree on one date and not on the deadlines.**\n\n| Date | Kickoff email (Raj, 21 Sep) | brief.md |\n|---|---|---|\n| Start / kickoff | 5 Oct 2026 — \"we agreed to start the rebrand on October 5\" | Kickoff 2026-10-05 ✓ same |\n| First review | mentioned (\"the first review\") but **no date given** | 2026-10-08 15:00 UTC |\n| Moodboard | **due Friday — 25 Sep 2026** | not mentioned |\n| Final files | **not mentioned** | **2026-11-20** |\n\nSo the email never states a final-files date, and the brief never mentions the moodboard or its 25 Sep deadline. The 8 Oct first review is named in both but only dated in the brief — the email''s invite for it came separately, on 24 Sep.\n\nThe upshot: **the 20 Nov deadline exists only in the brief.** It''s not been restated in any mail you can see, which is part of why it''s been easy to lose track of — no inbox message is chasing it.","metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"}}','assistant','v2','2026-11-10T10:19:34.647Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
