pr 11, Apr 1(arch), Mar 22, Mar 2, Feb 20(arch), Feb 10, Jan 21, Jan 11(arch), Jan 1, Dec 12 2025, Dec 2 (arch), Nov 22, Nov 2, Oct 23(arch), Oct 13, Sep 23, Sep 13(arch), Sep 3, Aug 14, Aug 4(arch), Jul 25, Jul 5, Jun 25(arch), Jun 15, May 26, May 16(arch), May 6, Apr 16, Apr 6(arch), Mar 27, Mar 7, Feb 25(arch), Feb 15, Jan 26, Jan 16(arch), Jan 6, Dec 17 2024, Dec 7 2024(arch), Nov 27 2024, Nov 7 2024 = let me count: that''s 55? The search said 56. Plus \"This week at the shop\" (Sep 26) is included. Let''s count carefully:\n1 Sep 26 2026\n2 Sep 18\n3 Sep 8\n4 Aug 29\n5 Aug 19\n6 Aug 9\n7 Jul 30\n8 Jul 20\n9 Jul 10\n10 Jun 30\n11 Jun 20\n12 Jun 10\n13 May 31\n14 May 21\n15 May 11\n16 May 1\n17 Apr 11\n18 Apr 1 (archive)\n19 Mar 22\n20 Mar 2\n21 Feb 20 (archive)\n22 Feb 10\n23 Jan 21\n24 Jan 11 (archive)\n25 Jan 1\n26 Dec 12 2025\n27 Dec 2 2025 (archive)\n28 Nov 22 2025\n29 Nov 2 2025\n30 Oct 23 2025 (archive)\n31 Oct 13 2025\n32 Sep 23 2025\n33 Sep 13 2025 (archive)\n34 Sep 3 2025\n35 Aug 14 2025\n36 Aug 4 2025 (archive)\n37 Jul 25 2025\n38 Jul 5 2025\n39 Jun 25 2025 (archive)\n40 Jun 15 2025\n41 May 26 2025\n42 May 16 2025 (archive)\n43 May 6 2025\n44 Apr 16 2025\n45 Apr 6 2025 (archive)\n46 Mar 27 2025\n47 Mar 7 2025\n48 Feb 25 2025 (archive)\n49 Feb 15 2025\n50 Jan 26 2025\n51 Jan 16 2025 (archive)\n52 Jan 6 2025\n53 Dec 17 2024\n54 Dec 7 2024 (archive)\n55 Nov 27 2024\n56 Nov 7 2024\n= 56 ✓\n\nPlus Kestrel one-offs: \"15% off this weekend only\" (Aug 14 2026), \"Spring sale starts now\" (Mar 20 2026), \"Black Friday: 25% off stoneware\" (Nov 27 2025), \"Black Friday: 20% off everything\" (Nov 28 2024), \"Mother''s Day: free gift wrapping\" (May 9 2025) — those are promotional broadcasts rather than the newsletter proper. From earlier listings: trash had several Kestrel ones too (deleted). \n\n2. **Codeyard** — \"Your weekly Codeyard digest\" — dates: Sep 7 2026, Aug 24, Jul 27, Jun 29, Jun 1, ... plus earlier (Jul 22 build failed is transactional, not digest)