ole drive |\n\nTwo things worth knowing before you search:\n\n- **Drive 3 (ftp) is partial.** This workspace was granted only some of its folders, so anything outside the grant simply won''t appear — a missing file there isn''t proof it''s absent.\n- **Nothing here carries a friendly name.** Three of them are FTP servers and two are S3 buckets, all on the same account, and the listing distinguishes them only by id. So \"search my drive\" will fan out across seven endpoints with no way to tell you which FTP a hit came from unless I browse them.\n\nWant me to list the top level of each so we can put real names to them — that turns the whole set into something you can actually aim a question at?"}','assistant','v2','2026-11-10T10:25:49.017Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
